[resource]
script = ExtResource("2_2nrxl")
name = "Severe Low Vision"
icon = ExtResource("1_2nrxl")
short_info = "FIXED-WIDTH CONTAINER DETECTED"
manual_text = "[b][u]CLINICAL OVERVIEW[/u][/b]
Low vision represents a reduced visual acuity that cannot be fully corrected with standard glasses. Around 295 million people worldwide have moderate or severe vision impairment (MSVI), with a further 257 million experiencing mild impairment.

[b][u]EFFECTS & DAILY CHALLENGES[/u][/b]
[indent]
[b]•[/b] [u]Acuity Loss & Field of Vision:[/u] Causes global blurriness or blind spots (Scotoma, Tunnel Vision).
[b]•[/b] [u]Photophobia:[/u] Extreme sensitivity to light, making bright \"light mode\" interfaces painful.
[b]•[/b] These users often rely on magnification tools or larger text to read. If layouts are not adaptable, reading becomes exhausting.
[/indent]"
related_wcag = ExtResource("1_l6m8n")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://dry85ilgnq64e"
